  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Experts GAMMAL samlingsinsats SKA ST&#xc4;NGAS - Katja Salsb&#xe4;ck NE tom 20 jan 2013</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Nationella Experter GAMMAL saml insats SKA ST&#xc4;NGAS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Nationella Expertprogrammet v&#xe4;nder sig till experter p&#xe5;               bist&#xe5;ndsfr&#xe5;gor anst&#xe4;llda inom Sida och UD. NE kan vara anst&#xe4;llda i    Bryssel eller p&#xe5; EU Delegation i max 4 &#xe5;r. Huvudsyftet &#xe4;r             kunskapsutbyte och att f&#xe5; in fler svenskar i EU.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The National Expert Program is directed to experts in development     cooperation issues employed by Sida and MFA. They work as NE for a    maximum of 4 years in Brussels or in a EU Delegation. The main goal   with the program is exchange of knowledge and to have more Swedes     working within the EU.</narrative>
  </description>
